# label: alg:ch93-opt
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch93.tex:109
# caption: Apply local pure-core rewrites without erasing demanded divergent computation.

REQUIRE typed pure-core expression with exact integer and Boolean literal kinds
ENSURE expression with the same permitted value/termination behavior
recursively optimize expression children under binding-aware syntax cases
IF integer primitive operands are integer literals THEN
  fold exactly
END IF
IF add has right literal zero THEN
  replace by left operand
END IF
IF multiply has right literal one THEN
  replace by left operand
END IF
IF conditional test is a Boolean literal THEN
  retain only its selected arm
END IF
otherwise rebuild the original operator with optimized children

